@ addressed with its own literal and offset 0 (DESIGN.md 8.2).  FLASH_ACR is used by the SYS clock object only;
@ FLASH_PECR, FLASH_PEKEYR and FLASH_SR by the NVM objects only (DESIGN.md 9.3 item 2).
@ -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
